## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "plugins": ["lodash.grit"],
  "linter": {
    "rules": {
      "recommended": false
    }
  }
}
```

## `lodash.grit`

```grit
language js

`import $clause from "lodash-es"` where {
    $clause <: contains `padStart`,
    register_diagnostic(
        span = $clause,
        message = "Prefer native String.padStart() over the lodash version",
        severity = "error"
    )
}

```

